  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5921.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5921.01 Scope. These quality management (QM) administrative rules will apply to the division, the coordinating board, medical control board, or EMS units who implement a quality management program that meets or exceeds the requirements of Saf-C 5921.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
